        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>36 Inch Residential Bumper Threshold, PEM-205Ax</b><p>\r\nPemko's 36\" threshold is for outswinging residential doors.  It is ramped on interior and when closed, the door butts up to the vinyl bumper or pile insert on the exterior creating a high-dam barrier seal from the elements.\r\n</p><p>\r\nField sizable, non-handed. Powder coated finish.  Packaged with installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Pemko 205Ax Door Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length:  36\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width:  3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Clear Powder Coated</li>\r\n<li>Available with pile or Thermo Seal insert</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
